# The Name of Evil - 1 (Q125): a level 76 character that met the Elroki (Q124, its
# journal seeded) accepts at Mushika, who gives Gazkh's fragment; Karakawei sends it for two
# ornithomimus claws and two deinonychus bones (every drop roll pinned to succeed), then to the
# three Kaimu stones (a wrong answer at Ulu Kaimu first), whose last turns the fragment into the
# epitaph of wisdom, and Mushika takes it; then relog. Mushika and Karakawei also list Q124, so
# their dialog goes through the quest chooser. Each stone asks itself to cast a skill as it talks;
# no AI tick runs here, so none casts (q125_the_name_of_evil_1_kaimu_cast). Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q125_the_name_of_evil_1.golden
character Seeker 76
random always 0
quest Q124_MeetingTheElroki <state>=COMPLETED
script quest.Q124_MeetingTheElroki
script quest.Q125_TheNameOfEvil_1
item 8779 8780 8781 8782
page default/32114.htm
page default/32117.htm
page default/32119.htm
page default/32120.htm
page default/32121.htm
